+//
+// Note that collapsing a single dimension does nothing:
+//
+//    {256} collapsing {0} => {256}
+//    {1} collapsing {0} => {1}
+//
+// Collapsing multiple dimensions produces a single result dimension:
+//
+//    {256, 2} collapsing {0,1} => {512}
